{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测外部客户端调用Thrift RPC方法。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Thrift RPC Method from an External Client。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.thrift-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】外部客户端调用Thrift RPC方法","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n外部客户端调用Thrift RPC方法\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2018-1320","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/","https://thrift.apache.org/docs/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"3b15d24d-03e8-422c-b260-e0834e5fec83","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"data_stream.dataset:network_traffic.thrift and\nclient.ip:(\n  * and\n  not (\n    10.0.0.0/8 or\n    100.64.0.0/10 or\n    127.0.0.0/8 or\n    169.254.0.0/16 or\n    172.16.0.0/12 or\n    192.0.0.0/24 or\n    192.0.2.0/24 or\n    192.31.196.0/24 or\n    192.52.193.0/24 or\n    192.88.99.0/24 or\n    192.168.0.0/16 or\n    192.175.48.0/24 or\n    198.18.0.0/15 or\n    198.51.100.0/24 or\n    203.0.113.0/24 or\n    224.0.0.0/4 or\n    240.0.0.0/4 or\n    \"::1\" or\n    \"fc00::/7\" or\n    \"fe80::/10\" or\n    \"ff00::/8\"\n  )\n) and\nserver.ip:* and\nnetwork_traffic.thrift.method:*\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1190","name":"Exploit Public-Facing Application","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["client.ip","server.ip"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"netw